flowchart LR
    citizen[Citizen\nTarget beneficiary]
    officer[Government Officer\nAuthenticated MVP actor]
    supervisor[Government Supervisor\nAuthenticated MVP actor]
    system[Government Domain Copilot\nD4 grounded-response MVP]
    postgres[(PostgreSQL + pgvector\nMVP)]
    gemini[Google Gemini API\nConfigured external provider]
    ollama[Local Ollama server\nOptional configured external provider]
    corpus[Synthetic corpus files\nCommitted MVP assets]
    idp[Production identity provider\nTarget only]
    official[Official governed sources\nTarget only]

    citizen -->|situation / receives officer-reviewed response| officer
    officer -->|authenticated requests| system
    supervisor -->|approve / reject / execute staged request| system
    system -->|tenant-scoped persistence and retrieval| postgres
    system -->|bounded completion / embedding requests| gemini
    system -. optional local completion / embedding .-> ollama
    corpus -->|validate / authenticated seed| system
    idp -. trusted production identity .-> system
    official -. governed source ingestion .-> system

    classDef current fill:#d9ead3,stroke:#38761d,color:#000;
    classDef external fill:#cfe2f3,stroke:#1155cc,color:#000;
    classDef target fill:#fce5cd,stroke:#e69138,color:#000,stroke-dasharray: 5 5;
    class system,postgres,corpus current;
    class gemini,ollama external;
    class idp,official,target;
